{"page":544,"verses":[{"verse_key":"58:12","surah":58,"ayah":12,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوٓا۟ إِذَا نَـٰجَيْتُمُ ٱلرَّسُولَ فَقَدِّمُوا۟ بَيْنَ يَدَىْ نَجْوَىٰكُمْ صَدَقَةً ۚ ذَٰلِكَ خَيْرٌ لَّكُمْ وَأَطْهَرُ ۚ فَإِن لَّمْ تَجِدُوا۟ فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ غَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You who believe, when you come to speak privately with the Messenger, offer something in charity before your conversation: that is better for you and purer. If you do not have the means, God is most forgiving and merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"58:12"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"58:12"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"O you who believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"58:12"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"When","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"58:12"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نَـٰجَيْتُمُ","en_gloss":"you privately consult","transliteration":"nājaytumu","verse_key":"58:12"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلرَّسُولَ","en_gloss":"the Messenger","transliteration":"l-rasūla","verse_key":"58:12"},{"pos":7,"ar":"فَقَدِّمُوا۟","en_gloss":"then offer","transliteration":"faqaddimū","verse_key":"58:12"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بَيْنَ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"bayna","verse_key":"58:12"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَدَىْ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"yaday","verse_key":"58:12"},{"pos":10,"ar":"نَجْوَىٰكُمْ","en_gloss":"your private consultation","transliteration":"najwākum","verse_key":"58:12"},{"pos":11,"ar":"صَدَقَةًۭ ۚ","en_gloss":"charity","transliteration":"ṣadaqatan","verse_key":"58:12"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","en_gloss":"That","transliteration":"dhālika","verse_key":"58:12"},{"pos":13,"ar":"خَيْرٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) better","transliteration":"khayrun","verse_key":"58:12"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"58:12"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَأَطْهَرُ ۚ","en_gloss":"and purer","transliteration":"wa-aṭharu","verse_key":"58:12"},{"pos":16,"ar":"فَإِن","en_gloss":"But if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"58:12"},{"pos":17,"ar":"لَّمْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"58:12"},{"pos":18,"ar":"تَجِدُوا۟","en_gloss":"you find","transliteration":"tajidū","verse_key":"58:12"},{"pos":19,"ar":"فَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"then indeed","transliteration":"fa-inna","verse_key":"58:12"},{"pos":20,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"58:12"},{"pos":21,"ar":"غَفُورٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"ghafūrun","verse_key":"58:12"},{"pos":22,"ar":"رَّحِيمٌ","en_gloss":"Most Merciful","transliteration":"raḥīmun","verse_key":"58:12"},{"pos":23,"ar":"١٢","en_gloss":"(12)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"58:12"}]},{"verse_key":"58:13","surah":58,"ayah":13,"ar_uthmani":"ءَأَشْفَقْتُمْ أَن تُقَدِّمُوا۟ بَيْنَ يَدَىْ نَجْوَىٰكُمْ صَدَقَـٰتٍ ۚ فَإِذْ لَمْ تَفْعَلُوا۟ وَتَابَ ٱللَّهُ عَلَيْكُمْ فَأَقِيمُوا۟ ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ وَءَاتُوا۟ ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ وَأَطِيعُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَرَسُولَهُۥ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ خَبِيرٌۢ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Were you afraid to give charity before consulting the Prophet? Since you did not give charity, and God has relented towards you, you should [at least] observe your prayers, pay the prescribed alms, and obey God and His Messenger: God is well aware of your actions.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ءَأَشْفَقْتُمْ","en_gloss":"Are you afraid","transliteration":"a-ashfaqtum","verse_key":"58:13"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"58:13"},{"pos":3,"ar":"تُقَدِّمُوا۟","en_gloss":"offer","transliteration":"tuqaddimū","verse_key":"58:13"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بَيْنَ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"bayna","verse_key":"58:13"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَدَىْ","en_gloss":"before","transliteration":"yaday","verse_key":"58:13"},{"pos":6,"ar":"نَجْوَىٰكُمْ","en_gloss":"your private consultation","transliteration":"najwākum","